<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><p class="kicker">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Washington</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in a Bellevue condo, a Wenatchee foothills home and a wheat farm on the Palouse.</p></div><div class="regions" data-stagger><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/seattle-skyline.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/seattle-skyline-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/seattle-skyline.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="region-in"><h3>Puget Sound</h3><p class="region-c">King, Pierce, Snohomish, Kitsap, Thurston counties</p><p>Windstorms, falling firs, water losses and the occasional arctic blast hit the most densely insured part of the state.</p><p class="region-l">City pages: <a href="/cities-we-serve/seattle/">Seattle</a>, <a href="/cities-we-serve/bellevue/">Bellevue</a>, <a href="/cities-we-serve/tacoma/">Tacoma</a>, <a href="/cities-we-serve/everett/">Everett</a>, <a href="/cities-we-serve/olympia/">Olympia</a>, <a href="/cities-we-serve/bremerton/">Bremerton</a></p></div></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles-roof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="region-in"><h3>North Sound &amp; San Juans</h3><p class="region-c">Whatcom, Skagit, San Juan, Island counties</p><p>Fraser outflow winds, hard freezes and atmospheric river rains, including the record November 2021 floods.</p><p class="region-l">City pages: <a href="/cities-we-serve/bellingham/">Bellingham</a></p></div></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/columbia-river.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/columbia-river-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/columbia-river.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="region-in"><h3>Southwest Washington &amp; Coast</h3><p class="region-c">Clark, Cowlitz, Lewis, Grays Harbor, Pacific counties</p><p>Columbia Gorge ice storms, coastal gales and river flooding, plus fast suburban growth around Vancouver.</p><p class="region-l">City pages: <a href="/cities-we-serve/vancouver/">Vancouver</a></p></div></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-hillside.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-hillside-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-hillside.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="region-in"><h3>Central Washington</h3><p class="region-c">Chelan, Kittitas, Okanogan, Yakima counties</p><p>Wildfire country on the east slope of the Cascades, with heavy snow, orchards and farm buildings.</p><p class="region-l">City pages: <a href="/cities-we-serve/wenatchee/">Wenatchee</a>, <a href="/cities-we-serve/yakima/">Yakima</a></p></div></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-sky-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-sky.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="region-in"><h3>Columbia Basin</h3><p class="region-c">Benton, Franklin, Grant, Walla Walla counties</p><p>Wind, dust, hail and range fires across a hot, dry basin and the Tri-Cities.</p><p class="region-l">City pages: <a href="/cities-we-serve/tri-cities/">Tri-Cities</a></p></div></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="region-in"><h3>Inland Northwest &amp; Palouse</h3><p class="region-c">Spokane, Stevens, Whitman, Lincoln counties</p><p>Hail, windstorms, snow load, ice storms and some of the state’s most destructive recent wildfires.</p><p class="region-l">City pages: <a href="/cities-we-serve/spokane/">Spokane</a></p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your city?</h2><p>We cover all 39 Washington counties. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/talk-to-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
